---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Leow Kah Man"
  description="Background, engineering philosophy, and architectural perspectives of Leow Kah Man."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-8">
        <div class="w-28 h-28 sm:w-32 sm:h-32 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex-shrink-0 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900">
          <img
            src="/favicon.png"
            alt="Leow Kah Man"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            width="512"
            height="512"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center sm:text-left space-y-4">
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
            Leow Kah Man
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
            Software architect and technology leader with over two decades of engineering experience. Championing an AI-first development philosophy, pragmatic systems architecture, and resilient execution.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Engineering Leadership & Philosophy -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
        Engineering Leadership &amp; Philosophy
      </h2>
      <div class="prose-tech space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Over the past two decades in software engineering, my career has evolved from writing core backend code to steering systems architecture and guiding engineering teams across high-growth product ecosystems.
        </p>
        <p>
          I view technology leadership through a lens of <strong>engineering pragmatism</strong>: prioritising maintainable primitives over short-lived trends, and architecting systems that are resilient, observable, and cost-efficient.
        </p>
        <p>
          My technical mindset and architectural focus center on four key areas:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            AI-First Engineering &amp; Autonomous SDLC
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Applying an AI-first mindset across the entire software delivery lifecycle. Implementing autonomous execution harnesses, agentic workflows, and automated PR quality gates that dramatically accelerate engineering cadence while maintaining architectural consistency.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Engineering Craftsmanship &amp; Mentorship
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Cultivating engineering cultures anchored in clean code, small composable components, and high standards. Mentoring engineers and technical leads to build with ownership, rigor, and long-term maintainability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Systems Decoupling &amp; Microservices
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Methodically decomposing complex monolithic platforms into resilient, event-driven microservices. Applying Domain-Driven Design (DDD) to establish clean domain boundaries and eliminate systemic single points of failure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Cloud Architecture &amp; Operational Resilience
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Designing high-availability platforms across hybrid and multi-cloud environments (AWS, Azure, AliCloud). Standardising container orchestration with Kubernetes, zero-downtime CI/CD deployment pipelines, and predictable system reliability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Editorial Transparency Note -->
    <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold">Editorial Transparency:</strong> While post drafting, formatting, diagrams, and synthesis across this publication are assisted by AI, every architectural opinion and engineering stance originates directly from myself.
    </section>

    <!-- Connect / LinkedIn Box (Soft Cream Styling, No GitHub) -->
    <section class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF7F2] dark:bg-slate-900 border border-amber-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          Connect
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
          For executive networking, technology advisory, or engineering leadership discussions, connect with me directly on LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kmleow"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-400"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current mr-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
          </svg>
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
